# `.cursor/rules` scope (Assistedly.ai)

**Canonical generic Cursor rules** live in **`https://github.com/JoshFialkoff/Agile-Cursor`** (`.cursor/rules/`). That repo is the **catalog**; this folder holds **Assistedly.ai–specific** overrides only (production domain, real GitHub owner/repo in examples, internal `launchd` names, etc.).

To load shared rules while working here, copy the needed `.mdc` files from Agile Cursor into `.cursor/rules/`, or add the Agile Cursor checkout as another workspace folder.
